          <h3>24/7 operations</h3>
          <p>NOC and SOC operating around the clock. Monitoring, patching, and incident response while your team sleeps. We take the 3am calls.</p>
          <p>Our operations centre runs 24 hours a day, 7 days a week, 365 days a year. Network monitoring, security monitoring, patching, capacity planning, and incident response happen continuously — not during business hours, not when someone is available, but as a structured operational function with documented runbooks, escalation trees, and SLA-backed response times.</p>
          <p>When an alert fires at 3am, the engineer who picks it up is part of the team that built the infrastructure. They know the topology, they know the runbook, and they know the escalation path. There is no "we will get back to you in the morning" — there is immediate triage, diagnosis, and resolution by the team that owns the system.</p>
